    "summary": {
      "value": "Gain bonuses with daggers and treat them as brawling, sword, and thrown weapons."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Rogue</strong> or <strong>Weaponmaster</strong>.</p><hr><p>While you have one or more <strong>melee dagger weapons</strong> equipped, you gain a +1 bonus to Defense and Magic Defense, and you treat those <strong>weapons</strong> as also belonging to the <strong>brawling</strong>, <strong>sword</strong>, and <strong>thrown</strong> Categories for the purpose of Skills and effects.</p><p>Additionally, your attacks with <strong>weapons</strong> that belong to the <strong>dagger</strong> Category may target creatures that cannot normally be targeted by <strong>melee</strong> attacks.</p>",
